sequenceDiagram
  participant Sender as Inbound sender
  participant EmailWorker as Cloudflare Email Worker
  participant R2 as R2 raw archive
  participant Queue as Queue / D1 event
  participant Agent as App or agent
  participant Approval as Approval policy
  participant Provider as Resend / Postmark

  Sender->>EmailWorker: Send email
  EmailWorker->>EmailWorker: Validate sender, size, attachments
  EmailWorker->>R2: Store raw copy when needed
  EmailWorker->>Queue: Write normalized event
  Queue->>Agent: Process structured task
  Agent->>Approval: Propose outbound response
  Approval-->>Agent: Allow, reject, or require human review
  Agent->>Provider: Send approved transactional email
